This is a simple 4x4 keypad matrix setup with OLED that will show what buttons is pressed on the OLED screen. 
Buttons here are configured as:
  {'1','2','3','A'},
  {'4','5','6','B'},
  {'7','8','9','C'},
  {'*','0','#','D'}

Keypad Pin	Connects to ESP32 GPIO	
R1	-> GPIO 14	
R2	-> GPIO 12	
R3	-> GPIO 13	
R4	-> GPIO 4	
C1	-> GPIO 32	
C2	-> GPIO 33	
C3	-> GPIO 25	
C4	-> GPIO 26	

OLED Pin	Connects to ESP32	
VCC	-> 3.3 V	
GND	-> GND	
SDA	-> GPIO 
SCL	-> GPIO 22	